  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ea90144ef4ac7a4699131a7438e0496, type: 3}
  m_Name: C3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I put her back where she was previously... And hear a
      strange mettalic 'chink' under her. Cranking my neck to better see...
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Three keys have appeared on my shelf. A small one, a golden
      one, and a large one. The same keys from my dream, laying around the statuette.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I extend my hand, fearing this is an hallucination...
      But the metallic texture is quite real. The keys feel rugged and heavy in my
      hands. This isn't my mind playing tricks on me.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I take another glance at the statuette. Immobile, the
      little idol is turned towards me, the strands of light from the store lighting
      her lifeless ruby eyes. Something seems to dance inside the jewels, but it
      dissapears as soon as I notice it.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Was it all really a dream...?
    TextAlignment: 257
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
